# Bot1 controls Tainted Remedy ("If an opponent would gain life, that player loses that much life instead") and Bloodletter
# of Aclazotz, and on its turn 3 exiles Bot2's Healer's Hawk with Swords to Plowshares: Bot2 would gain 1 life. Only
# Tainted Remedy applies to a gain, and makes it a loss of 1; Bloodletter now applies to that loss (CR 616.1f) and doubles
# it: Bot2 loses 2 (20 -> 18). No choice is asked: at each step only one effect applies.

